{% comment %}
  ZAVELYN HAIR CARE — T01 Editorial Application & Styling Guide (v3.1)
  Honest tutorial presentation with verified static styling photography and zero fake play controls
{% endcomment %}
<section class="zvhc-video-carousel-section" id="community">
  <div class="zvhc-container">
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; align-items: center;" class="zvhc-editorial-grid">
      <div>
        <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;">STRAND APPLICATION TECHNIQUE</div>
        <h2 class="zvhc-h2">Targeted Scalp Care Designed for Textured Hair</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 24px;">
          Learn how to incorporate pure Honduran Batana Oil and Keratin Fibers into your wash day and morning styling routines for lightweight conditioning and immediate visual density.
        </p>

        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 24px;">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24);">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--zvhc-t01-trust-green, #3F8F6B)" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <span>Melts effortlessly into parted damp scalp without greasy buildup</span>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24);">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--zvhc-t01-trust-green, #3F8F6B)" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <span>Nourishes follicle roots and seals cuticles against thermal damage</span>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24);">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--zvhc-t01-trust-green, #3F8F6B)" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <span>Instant cosmetic coverage for temples, crown, and wide part lines</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-left: 3px solid var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.45;">
          <strong>Educational Demonstration Disclosure:</strong> Images demonstrate standard cosmetic application techniques. Individual results may vary based on starting hair condition, porosity, and routine consistency. Not intended to diagnose, treat, or cure clinical alopecia.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Static Editorial Technique Card (Honest, No Fake Video Controls) -->
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <div class="zvhc-video-card" style="max-width: 340px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative;">
          <img 
            src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0826/2483/9865/files/zvhc-3256807907799249-gallery-02.jpg?v=1795264420" 
            alt="Pure Batana Oil Scalp Application Technique" 
            loading="lazy"
            style="width: 100%; border-radius: 14px; display: block;"
          >
          <div class="zvhc-video-overlay" style="border-radius: 14px;">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
              <span style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95); color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 9999px; text-transform: uppercase;">
                Tutorial Guide
              </span>
              <span style="color: #FFF; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 600;">Scalp Ritual</span>
            </div>
            
            <div style="margin-top: auto; text-align: left;">
              <div style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 2px;">Daily Part &amp; Massage Routine</div>
              <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; opacity: 0.85;">Pure Honduran Batana Application</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

